sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CLI
    participant MTMD as libmtmd
    participant CLIP as Clip Encoder<br>(clip.cpp)
    participant LLAMA as llama.cpp Core
    participant TEXT as Text Model (GGUF)
    participant MMPROJ as mmproj (GGUF)

    User->>MTMD: mtmd_init_from_file(mmproj, text_model, params)
    MTMD->>MMPROJ: clip_init(fname, params)
    MMPROJ-->>CLIP: Vision/Audio tensors loaded
    CLIP->>CLIP: warmup() -- one encode pass
    CLIP-->>MTMD: clip_ctx (vision + optional audio)
    MTMD->>MTMD: Validate n_embd matches text model
    MTMD->>MTMD: init_vision() / init_audio()
    MTMD->>MTMD: Select image preprocessor by projector type
    MTMD-->>User: mtmd_context*

    Note over User,LLAMA: === TOKENIZE PHASE ===

    User->>MTMD: mtmd_tokenize(ctx, "Describe: <__media__>", {bitmap})

    MTMD->>MTMD: split_text() at media markers

    alt Lazy bitmap (video)
        MTMD->>MTMD: expand_lazy_bitmaps() -- callback per frame
    end

    alt Qwen-VL style (frame merging)
        MTMD->>MTMD: Merge 2 consecutive frames into 1 batch
    end

    MTMD->>MTMD: add_media(bitmaps)
    MTMD->>MTMD: image_preproc->preprocess(img_u8)
    MTMD->>MTMD: Choose preprocessor strategy

    alt Fixed-size
        MTMD->>MTMD: resize to model image_size
    else Dynamic-size
        MTMD->>MTMD: resize to multiple of patch_size
    else LLaVA-UHD
        MTMD->>MTMD: slice_image() into overview + grid tiles
    end

    MTMD->>MTMD: Normalize pixels (mean/std)
    MTMD->>MTMD: Add special tokens (img_beg, img_end, slice tokens)

    MTMD->>MTMD: Build mtmd_input_chunks (interleaved text + image chunks)
    MTMD-->>User: mtmd_input_chunks*

    Note over User,LLAMA: === ENCODE + DECODE PHASE ===

    loop For each chunk
        User->>MTMD: mtmd_encode_chunk(ctx, chunk)

        alt chunk is TEXT
            MTMD-->>User: (no-op, text chunk ignored)
        else chunk is IMAGE
            MTMD->>CLIP: clip_image_batch_encode(ctx_v, n_threads, batch_f32)
            CLIP->>CLIP: Build model-specific computation graph
            CLIP->>CLIP: Execute ggml_backend_sched graph

            alt LLaVA
                CLIP->>CLIP: ViT + MLP projector (mm_fc_w/b)
            else Qwen2VL
                CLIP->>CLIP: 2D conv -> spatial merge -> M-RoPE -> merger
            else Qwen3VL
                CLIP->>CLIP: 2D conv -> deepstack features -> merger
            else InternVL
                CLIP->>CLIP: Signed pos embed -> ViT -> InternVL projector
            end

            CLIP-->>MTMD: float embeddings (n_tokens x n_embd)
            MTMD-->>User: 0 (success)
        else chunk is AUDIO
            MTMD->>CLIP: clip_image_batch_encode(ctx_a, ...)
            CLIP-->>MTMD: float embeddings
            MTMD-->>User: 0 (success)
        end

        User->>LLAMA: mtmd_helper_decode_image_chunk() or feed text tokens

        alt TEXT chunk tokens
            LLAMA->>TEXT: llama_decode(text_batch)
        else IMAGE/AUDIO embeddings (non-text)
            LLAMA->>LLAMA: Build llama_batch from embeddings
            alt M-RoPE model (QwenVL)
                LLAMA->>LLAMA: Set pos[t,h,w] per token
            else Non-causal model (Gemma3)
                LLAMA->>LLAMA: Set non-causal attention mask
            end
            LLAMA->>TEXT: llama_decode(embd_batch)
        end

        LLAMA-->>User: logits, KV cache updated
    end

    Note over User,LLAMA: === GENERATION PHASE ===

    User->>LLAMA: llama_decode(next_token)
    LLAMA-->>User: token stream
